# "Whenever one or more creatures your opponents control are dealt excess noncombat damage": on turn 3 Anger of the Gods deals
# 3 to Bot1's own Ornithopter (0/2), 1 excess, and to Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2), 1 excess, together. The Bears make one
# Treasure; Bot1's own creature counts for nothing. On turn 7 a second Anger of the Gods exiles only Bot1's second Ornithopter,
# with excess: no Treasure, since no creature an opponent controls was dealt any.
